{"seq":2,"slug":"ab-testing-games","title":"游戏场景 A/B 测试方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-live-operations/data-driven/ab-testing-games","wordCount":2203,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"游戏场景-a-b-测试方法论\">游戏场景 A/B 测试方法论</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>A/B 测试</strong>：将假设转化为因果证据的随机对照实验，在游戏中回答「这个改动真的更好吗」</li>\n<li><strong>溢出效应</strong>：因社交互动或共享经济导致实验组行为「泄漏」到对照组，破坏因果推断</li>\n<li><strong>CUPED 方差缩减</strong>：利用实验前同指标值作为协变量，将方差减少 30-50%，等效减半样本量需求</li>\n<li><strong>护栏指标</strong>：实验中不允许恶化的底线度量（崩溃率、客服工单率），防止优化主指标时损害整体</li>\n<li><strong>因果增量（Causal Lift）</strong>：干预组与控制组的结果差异，区分「识别注定结果」与「改变结果」</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"a-b-测试在游戏中的特殊性\">A/B 测试在游戏中的特殊性</h2><p>A/B 测试是 LiveOps 中将「假设」转化为「证据」的核心工具——它回答「这个改动真的更好吗」而非依赖直觉判断。但游戏场景的 A/B 测试比 Web 产品复杂得多：用户之间存在社交互动（溢出效应）、游戏内经济是多玩家共享的系统（干扰效应）、玩家行为高度非平稳（活动周期、赛季更替导致基线波动）、且核心指标（如 LTV）的观测周期极长。</p>\n<p>忽视这些特殊性的 naive A/B 测试会导致两种典型错误：<strong>假阳性</strong>（一个实际无效的改动被判定有效，因为恰好赶上活动高峰）和<strong>错误归因</strong>（改动有效但原因不是你以为的那个，因为社交溢出让对照组也受益）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实验设计框架\">实验设计框架</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 实验生命周期&#10;        A[假设定义] --&gt; B[指标选择]&#10;        B --&gt; C[样本量计算]&#10;        C --&gt; D[分流方案]&#10;        D --&gt; E[实验运行]&#10;        E --&gt; F[数据收集]&#10;        F --&gt; G[统计分析]&#10;        G --&gt; H[决策与推全]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 质量门&#10;        B --&gt; Q1[主指标+护栏指标]&#10;        C --&gt; Q2[MDE+统计功效]&#10;        D --&gt; Q3[隔离性验证]&#10;        G --&gt; Q4[因果推断验证]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 实验生命周期\n        A[假设定义] --&gt; B[指标选择]\n        B --&gt; C[样本量计算]\n        C --&gt; D[分流方案]\n        D --&gt; E[实验运行]\n        E --&gt; F[数据收集]\n        F --&gt; G[统计分析]\n        G --&gt; H[决策与推全]\n    end\n    subgraph 质量门\n        B --&gt; Q1[主指标+护栏指标]\n        C --&gt; Q2[MDE+统计功效]\n        D --&gt; Q3[隔离性验证]\n        G --&gt; Q4[因果推断验证]\n    end</pre><p><strong>假设定义</strong>的标准格式：「对于 [目标人群]，如果我们 [做什么改动]，那么 [主指标] 将在 [时间窗口] 内改善 [预期幅度]，因为 [因果机制]」。模糊的假设（如「改了应该会更好」）导致模糊的结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指标体系设计\">指标体系设计</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>游戏场景示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主指标（Primary）</td>\n<td>实验要优化的核心度量</td>\n<td>D7 留存率、ARPDAU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次要指标（Secondary）</td>\n<td>帮助解释主指标变化的辅助度量</td>\n<td>Session 时长、活动参与率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>护栏指标（Guardrail）</td>\n<td>不允许恶化的底线度量</td>\n<td>崩溃率、客服工单率、NPS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>诊断指标（Diagnostic）</td>\n<td>用于 debug 异常结果的过程度量</td>\n<td>功能触达率、转化漏斗各步</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>常见陷阱——代理指标偏差</strong>：选择容易测量的短期指标（如 D1 留存）作为难以测量的长期指标（如 LTV）的代理。问题是两者的相关性可能在特定情境下断裂——一个活动可能通过免费礼物短期拉高 D1 留存，但吸引来的是低质量用户，长期 LTV 反而下降。</p>\n<p>解决方案：建立「北极星指标」到「代理指标」的因果链条并持续验证。如果发现代理指标与北极星的相关性 &lt; 0.6，说明代理选择有问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"样本量与实验时长\">样本量与实验时长</h2><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = \\frac{(Z_{\\alpha/2} + Z_{\\beta})^2 \\cdot 2\\sigma^2}{\\delta^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2453em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5593em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7452em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z_{\\alpha/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0385em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为显著性水平对应的 Z 值（通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.96</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z=1.96</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z_{\\beta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为统计功效对应的 Z 值（通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\beta=0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.84</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z=0.84</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.84</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为指标方差，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 为最小可检测效应（MDE）。</p>\n<p><strong>游戏场景的复杂性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>玩家行为方差极大（鲸鱼 vs 免费玩家的 ARPDAU 差异可达 100 倍），导致 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 极大</li>\n<li>需要分层抽样或 CUPED（Controlled-experiment Using Pre-Experiment Data）方差缩减</li>\n<li>建议 MDE 设为 ≥5%——游戏中 &lt;5% 的效应通常不具备商业意义</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>实验时长决定</strong>：至少覆盖一个完整的自然周期（7 天涵盖工作日+周末模式），理想覆盖 2-4 周以捕获次周效应。但不要超过 6 周——长期实验容易受到外部事件干扰且延迟决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分流策略与隔离性\">分流策略与隔离性</h2><p>分流是实验正确性的关键——如果实验组和对照组之间存在信息泄漏，因果推断就失效了。</p>\n<p><strong>玩家级分流</strong>（最常用）：根据 player_id 的 hash 值分配到实验/对照组。适用于大多数个体体验优化（UI、关卡、教学流程）。</p>\n<p><strong>公会/社交圈分流</strong>：当改动涉及社交互动时（如新的公会功能），必须按社交单元分流——否则实验组玩家的行为变化会通过社交关系「溢出」到对照组。</p>\n<p><strong>服务器级分流</strong>：经济类改动（如掉率调整）可能需要按服务器分流，因为同服玩家共享交易市场——一个组的经济变化会通过市场影响另一个组。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分流粒度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>玩家级</td>\n<td>UI/UX、教学、个人进度</td>\n<td>样本量大、统计功效高</td>\n<td>社交溢出风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公会级</td>\n<td>社交功能、团队机制</td>\n<td>隔离社交效应</td>\n<td>样本量小、方差大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务器级</td>\n<td>经济调整、匹配规则</td>\n<td>完全隔离</td>\n<td>样本量极小、需多服</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"游戏特有的统计挑战\">游戏特有的统计挑战</h2><p><strong>非平稳基线</strong>：游戏 DAU 和 ARPDAU 的基线受赛季、活动、节假日影响剧烈波动。解决方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>实验前建立基线预测模型，用实际值与预测值的偏差作为分析输入</li>\n<li>使用 CUPED 方差缩减：将实验前同指标值作为协变量</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>CUPED</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>pre,treatment</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>pre,control</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\tau}_{\\text{CUPED}} = \\hat{\\tau} - \\theta(\\bar{Y}_{\\text{pre,treatment}} - \\bar{Y}_{\\text{pre,control}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CUPED</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pre,treatment</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pre,control</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>CUPED 通常可将方差减少 30-50%，等效于将所需样本量减半。</p>\n<p><strong>长期效应延迟</strong>：许多游戏改动的真实效果需要 14-30 天才能充分显现（如留存、LTV）。但等待完整观测窗口会大幅延迟决策。折中方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用短期代理指标做初步判断（48h 内的参与度变化）</li>\n<li>建立「短期指标 → 长期指标」的预测模型，用于实时估算长期效果</li>\n<li>对高风险改动保留长期观测窗口，低风险改动基于短期代理快速决策</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>多重测试问题</strong>：同时运行多个实验会膨胀假阳性率。如果同时跑 20 个实验，每个 α=0.05，预期 1 个会产生假阳性结果。解决方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Bonferroni 校正（保守）</li>\n<li>False Discovery Rate（FDR）控制（平衡）</li>\n<li>分层假设结构：主指标使用严格 α，次要指标允许更宽松</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"因果推断与干预效果评估\">因果推断与干预效果评估</h2><p>A/B 测试的终极目的不是「证明改动有效果」，而是证明「效果是因为改动造成的」（因果关系，非相关性）。</p>\n<p><strong>反事实估计</strong>：一个玩家在实验组留存了，但 TA 如果在对照组也会留存吗？无法直接观测反事实，只能通过群体层面的统计推断。</p>\n<p><strong>留存干预的因果验证</strong>：向流失风险玩家发送挽留礼物后，如何判断是「礼物」留住了他们还是他们「本来就不会走」？必须设置一个控制组——故意不给同等风险的一部分人发礼物——通过比较两组的实际流失率来量化<strong>因果增量</strong>（causal lift）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Causal Lift</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>Retention</mtext><mtext>treatment</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>Retention</mtext><mtext>control</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Causal Lift} = \\text{Retention}_{\\text{treatment}} - \\text{Retention}_{\\text{control}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Causal Lift</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Retention</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">treatment</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Retention</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">control</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>如果 Causal Lift ≈ 0，说明你的模型只是在「识别本来就会留下的人」而非「拯救即将流失的人」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"multi-armed-bandit-与动态实验\">Multi-Armed Bandit 与动态实验</h2><p>传统 A/B 测试是「先学习后利用」（固定分流比，实验结束后全量推优胜者）。在快节奏的 LiveOps 中，可以考虑动态分配方案：</p>\n<p><strong>Contextual Bandit</strong>：根据实时表现动态调整各方案的流量分配——表现好的方案获得更多流量，减少对差方案的「浪费」。适用于：offer 选择、推送时机、活动参数调优。</p>\n<p><strong>注意事项</strong>：Bandit 牺牲了统计严谨性换取收益效率，不适用于需要严格因果推断的场景（如核心循环改动）。用于低风险、高频决策（如最优推送文案）时价值最大。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>游戏 A/B 测试远比 Web 产品复杂——社交互动导致溢出效应、共享经济导致干扰效应、非平稳基线导致假阳性、长观测周期导致决策延迟。应对这些挑战需要严谨的实验设计：按隔离需求选择分流粒度、用 CUPED 缩减方差、建立代理-北极星指标链、通过 holdout 实验验证因果增量。Multi-Armed Bandit 适合低风险高频决策场景，但不能替代需要严格因果推断的核心改动验证。实验平台的建设投入是 LiveOps 从「猜测驱动」升级到「证据驱动」的分水岭。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>相关文档</strong>：<a href=\"churn-prediction-retention\">流失预测与留存干预</a> 直接依赖 A/B 测试框架来验证预测模型的因果增量。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"游戏场景 A/B 测试方法论","id":"游戏场景-a-b-测试方法论"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"A/B 测试在游戏中的特殊性","id":"a-b-测试在游戏中的特殊性"},{"level":2,"text":"实验设计框架","id":"实验设计框架"},{"level":2,"text":"指标体系设计","id":"指标体系设计"},{"level":2,"text":"样本量与实验时长","id":"样本量与实验时长"},{"level":2,"text":"分流策略与隔离性","id":"分流策略与隔离性"},{"level":2,"text":"游戏特有的统计挑战","id":"游戏特有的统计挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"因果推断与干预效果评估","id":"因果推断与干预效果评估"},{"level":2,"text":"Multi-Armed Bandit 与动态实验","id":"multi-armed-bandit-与动态实验"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"游戏遥测与实时分析架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-live-operations/data-driven/game-telemetry"},"next":{"title":"流失预测与主动留存干预","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-live-operations/data-driven/churn-prediction-retention"}}